  "keyFeatures": [
    "Typed memory with explicit schemas and lifecycles",
    "Revisable knowledge with supersede, fork, retract, merge, and contest operations",
    "Competence learning for procedural knowledge",
    "Decay and consolidation for memory management",
    "Trust-aware retrieval with sensitivity levels",
    "LLM-based semantic extraction",
    "Vector-aware retrieval with pgvector",
    "gRPC API with TypeScript and Python SDKs",
    "Embedded Go library",
    "Built-in observability and metrics"
